T*
(   Flow: ignore_email -> update_memory -> mark_processed -> END) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. draft) Tj
T*
(   Reason: low-risk replyable email) Tj
T*
(   Flow: retrieve_context -> draft_reply -> safety_check -> Delivery decision) Tj
T*
(   Delivery decision:) Tj
T*
(   - AUTO_SEND = true and safe_to_send = true -> Auto send) Tj
T*
